--[[
@description 7R ReaDancer
@author 7thResonance
@version 1.6.7
@provides 
  [extension win64] reaper_7R_ReaDancer.dll > reaper_7R_ReaDancer.dll
  [extension win64] Dance_Large.png > 7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.png
  [extension win64] Dance_Large.txt > 7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.txt
  [effect win64] 7R_ReaDancer_Energy.jsfx
@about 
  simplified version of FL fruity dancer inspired by peloreaper's extention
    added the following.
        No dedicated window. dancers lives inside reaper's window
        Remebers position of the dancer
        Accompanied JSFX for the dancer to react to configurable energy level fo the track. (monitoring FX)
        Auto Start
        FL chan is the default (its included, whats the worst thing that could happen?)
@changelog - initial release
--]]